WEBVTT

00:01.960 --> 00:03.520
"Sure thing."

00:03.520 --> 00:05.100
How do I say that in sign language?

00:12.900 --> 00:17.190
<i>Ever since that day, 
the more I think back to Itsuomi-san,</i>

00:17.680 --> 00:23.160
<i>the more this powdery, pearly white 
emotion piles up deep inside my heart.</i>

00:28.550 --> 00:31.180
<i>It keeps happening, even now.</i>

00:36.260 --> 00:39.180
Sorry to interrupt your little daydream, but...

00:39.180 --> 00:42.270
Are you okay on time?

00:43.170 --> 00:46.420
<i>I'm not okay... in any way.</i>

02:13.230 --> 02:16.990
To Affection

02:28.390 --> 02:32.000
Good for you, Yuki. You got his deets!

02:32.500 --> 02:38.510
Thanks for last night,
Rin-chan.

02:33.890 --> 02:36.680
Oh, c'mon! It was nothing!

02:36.680 --> 02:38.510
Anyway, were you nervous when you asked?

02:40.450 --> 02:42.010
You sure were, huh?

02:42.630 --> 02:45.670
<i>Just being around him 
makes me nervous already.</i>

02:46.640 --> 02:51.770
Yeah, it's huge

02:46.640 --> 02:51.770
Let me in yours, Yuki

02:46.670 --> 02:50.870
<i>On top of that, he gave me the 
biggest surprise of my life so far...</i>

02:52.230 --> 02:53.830
<i>I keep going back to look at it.</i>

02:57.650 --> 02:59.280
The reason I suggested
we meet up at this place

02:59.280 --> 03:03.530
is because our Cultural Exchange Club
often gathers around here.

03:00.230 --> 03:03.530
<i>"Our Cultural Exchange Club"...</i>

03:08.210 --> 03:10.330
That was quite nice.

03:10.330 --> 03:12.970
Then let's go together next time!

03:12.970 --> 03:14.860
Yeah. Well...

03:14.860 --> 03:16.280
<i>Itsuomi-san.</i>

03:17.080 --> 03:20.700
There he goes, surrounded by hot girls again.

03:20.700 --> 03:24.840
But wait! There were some boys 
around until a moment ago, too!

03:28.530 --> 03:32.810
<i>The girls he's talking to are so pretty. 
Maybe they have parents from overseas?</i>

03:33.650 --> 03:38.170
<i>The way his mouth is moving... 
He's probably not speaking Japanese.</i>

03:38.820 --> 03:46.580
Yeah, it's huge

03:38.820 --> 03:46.580
Let me in yours, Yuki

03:39.360 --> 03:42.990
<i>Did he send me that because 
he doesn't meet many deaf people,</i>

03:42.990 --> 03:46.470
<i>intending it to be some kind of 
cultural exchange?</i>

03:47.350 --> 03:52.830
<i>Even if he did, I'm glad he's entered my life.</i>

03:54.070 --> 03:54.970
Oh...

03:55.920 --> 03:57.420
He's leaving.

04:03.930 --> 04:06.180
Itsuomi-san!

04:15.490 --> 04:16.410
<i>Huh?</i>

04:26.200 --> 04:29.420
<i>The thought of making 
eye contact makes me squee.</i>

04:33.190 --> 04:35.560
<i>Whoa, he's totally looking at me.</i>

04:39.430 --> 04:40.670
<i>No...</i>

04:41.210 --> 04:43.350
<i>I shouldn't look away.</i>

04:48.130 --> 04:51.560
Aren't you gonna do this stuff today?

04:51.560 --> 04:53.020
<i>So embarrassing!</i>

04:54.420 --> 04:55.720
<i>Uh...</i>

05:11.700 --> 05:14.460
Notes

05:12.400 --> 05:13.800
<i>I need to type.</i>

05:20.710 --> 05:23.710
<i>He's always so in my face!</i>

05:23.880 --> 05:25.720
Notes

05:23.880 --> 05:25.720
Done

05:23.880 --> 05:25.720
I do want to,
but we're at college right now.

05:26.000 --> 05:27.690
Huh...

05:29.400 --> 05:30.810
Wow, you're cute.

05:30.810 --> 05:31.970
<i>Huh?</i>

05:31.970 --> 05:35.040
<i>Did he just call me c-cute?</i>

05:35.040 --> 05:37.350
<i>I didn't misread his lips, right?</i>

05:38.700 --> 05:42.010
Oh, I gotta go. It's time for my flight.

05:42.010 --> 05:43.180
<i>Flight?!</i>

05:44.210 --> 05:45.830
<i>Where's he going this time?</i>

05:47.200 --> 05:50.490
<i>Ma... o... u...?</i>

05:51.360 --> 05:52.990
<i>The Demon Lord?</i>

05:53.640 --> 05:56.600
<i>La... Oh, it was "La."</i>

05:57.030 --> 05:59.960
<i>O... u...?</i>

06:03.670 --> 06:05.510
Message

06:03.670 --> 06:05.510
Now

06:03.670 --> 06:05.510
Going to Laos for a bit

06:04.120 --> 06:05.510
<i>Laos!</i>

06:14.260 --> 06:17.220
You two seem to be hitting it off.

06:18.200 --> 06:21.650
You seem so happy when you're with Itsuomi-san.

06:21.650 --> 06:23.770
It's like you're totally in love.

06:23.900 --> 06:26.650
I'm just crushing!

06:25.140 --> 06:26.650
What?!

06:27.000 --> 06:29.930
But you seemed different from yesterday.

06:29.930 --> 06:31.410
You were glowing!

06:31.960 --> 06:34.440
<i>"Different from yesterday"?</i>

06:34.910 --> 06:36.580
<i>Was I really?</i>

06:37.010 --> 06:41.460
<i>Wait, what's the difference 
between love and crushing, anyway?</i>

06:45.410 --> 06:47.400
Hey, Yuki.

06:47.860 --> 06:49.930
Look up there.

06:50.420 --> 06:52.860
Your childhood friend's looking this way.

06:54.310 --> 06:55.740
<i>Oushi-kun.</i>

06:58.430 --> 07:00.940
<b></b>Who was that?

06:58.430 --> 07:00.940
<b></b>Who was that?

07:01.750 --> 07:03.210
<i>He saw that, huh?</i>

07:03.810 --> 07:05.440
<b></b>A friend, why?

07:03.810 --> 07:05.440
<b></b>A friend, why?

07:06.190 --> 07:07.570
<b></b>You don't say...

07:06.190 --> 07:07.570
<b></b>You don't say...

07:08.150 --> 07:10.200
<b></b>What are you up to?

07:08.150 --> 07:10.200
<b></b>What are you up to?

07:10.900 --> 07:12.200
<b></b>Not much.

07:10.900 --> 07:12.200
<b></b>Not much.

07:17.360 --> 07:19.450
<i>I wonder what they're talking about.</i>

07:19.450 --> 07:22.100
<i>I can't read people's lips from the side.</i>

07:23.810 --> 07:27.150
Huh... You're friends with those girls, Oushi?

07:27.150 --> 07:30.340
They're cute. Invite them to a boozer sometime.

07:30.340 --> 07:33.470
The one with the longer hair is deaf.

07:33.470 --> 07:36.410
Oh? How deaf?

07:36.410 --> 07:37.840
Completely.

07:37.840 --> 07:38.720
Oh...

07:43.040 --> 07:45.230
Can hearing aids help with that?

07:45.230 --> 07:49.230
She uses them already. 
Still can't pick up any sounds.

07:53.680 --> 07:56.360
That sounds too complicated for me, but okay.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.660
See you later, Oushi.

07:57.660 --> 07:58.500
See ya.

08:03.460 --> 08:04.500
<b></b>What?

08:03.460 --> 08:04.500
<b></b>What?

08:07.920 --> 08:09.530
<i>He ignored me.</i>

08:11.380 --> 08:16.470
Your childhood friend
can speak sign language?
That's amazing.

08:14.010 --> 08:18.140
All he does is say
mean things to me in sign.

08:16.390 --> 08:18.140
Huh...

08:18.480 --> 08:21.350
But... He actually learned it, huh?

08:23.390 --> 08:24.060
<b>Rin</b>

08:23.390 --> 08:24.060
<b>Your childhood friend
can speak sign language?
That's amazing.</b>

08:23.940 --> 08:28.400
<b>Chats</b>

08:23.940 --> 08:28.400
<b></b>Search

08:23.980 --> 08:28.400
<b></b>\hDo you want souvenirs?
Or do you not?

08:23.980 --> 08:28.400
<b>Rin</b>

08:23.980 --> 08:28.400
<b></b>Huh...

08:24.880 --> 08:26.490
<i>Itsuomi-san...</i>

08:32.450 --> 08:35.620
See? Your face really is glowing again.

08:39.160 --> 08:43.660
Which do you think it is?

08:41.290 --> 08:43.660
I can't tell the difference
between crushing
and being in love...

08:44.540 --> 08:49.170
Rin-chan, you said you were
crushing on the boss, right?

08:47.420 --> 08:49.170
Oh, about that...

08:49.170 --> 08:52.360
After seeing him last night, 
I'm all in "I love him" mode!

08:52.360 --> 08:53.550
<i>You are?!</i>

08:53.550 --> 08:55.560
I mean, he's so nice.

08:59.460 --> 09:04.940
If you can't tell which it is, 
why don't you just pick one?

09:05.690 --> 09:09.690
I'm allowed to decide for myself?

09:07.940 --> 09:09.690
Yep <3

09:13.940 --> 09:17.110
<b></b>I want souvenirs. Take care,
 and have fun on your trip!

09:13.940 --> 09:17.240
<b></b>Going to Laos for a bit

09:13.940 --> 09:17.240
<b></b>Do you want souvenirs?
Or do you not?

09:17.110 --> 09:18.570
I want souvenirs. Take care,
 and have fun on your trip!

09:19.440 --> 09:21.990
<i>If I can decide which I am—</i>

09:22.770 --> 09:25.270
<i>in love with him, or just crushing...</i>

09:40.020 --> 09:41.100
Sir!

09:41.650 --> 09:43.740
Hey, sir!

10:03.560 --> 10:04.650
Oushi.

10:08.180 --> 10:09.290
Izumi.

10:11.400 --> 10:14.960
I guess you can be a good Samaritan at times.

10:14.960 --> 10:15.690
Wha?

10:16.620 --> 10:20.390
That's the first time I've seen you use sign 
language with anyone other than Yuki-san.

10:20.880 --> 10:22.980
Oh, really?

10:23.590 --> 10:27.290
Life must be difficult for the deaf.

10:27.290 --> 10:28.140
Yeah.

10:28.560 --> 10:34.620
If it weren't for you, that guy might 
have been mistaken for a fare evader.

10:38.400 --> 10:39.690
I guess.

10:40.520 --> 10:44.980
It's easier to put yourself 
in danger when you can't hear.

10:46.280 --> 10:49.960
So maybe they should stay 
where they're safe and not leave...

11:14.770 --> 11:19.180
<i>I wonder where Itsuomi-san is right now 
and what he's doing.</i>

11:27.940 --> 11:32.520
<i>Is it just a crush, or could it be love... huh?</i>

11:45.590 --> 11:47.850
<i>What? It's from Itsuomi-san!</i>

11:55.080 --> 11:56.650
<i>Wow.</i>

11:57.800 --> 11:59.980
<i>I'd never heard of such a place.</i>

12:02.870 --> 12:04.070
<i>They're cute!</i>

12:05.280 --> 12:06.450
<i>I had no idea...</i>

12:07.250 --> 12:09.030
<i>I'd never seen any of this before.</i>

12:12.230 --> 12:13.790
<i>Itsuomi-san...</i>

12:14.800 --> 12:17.140
<i>What kind of place 
is the one you're in right now?</i>

12:17.810 --> 12:20.250
<i>What kind of sights does it have,</i>

12:20.250 --> 12:22.680
<i>and what kind of times can you spend there?</i>

12:23.460 --> 12:28.420
<i>Are you not scared 
to set foot in unfamiliar worlds?</i>

12:37.560 --> 12:38.480
These pics look so good!

12:38.610 --> 12:42.570
These pics look so good!

12:42.490 --> 12:43.820
I'm staying in a
run-down $7 inn
tonight. The Wi-Fi's
so slow.

12:43.820 --> 12:45.500
<i>Seven dollars?!</i>

12:45.500 --> 12:47.430
<i>Some place to stay.</i>

12:49.580 --> 12:52.910
Gonna sleep. Later.

12:49.580 --> 12:53.000
I'm staying in a
run-down $7 inn
tonight. The Wi-Fi's
so slow.

12:50.420 --> 12:52.310
<i>He's so whimsical...</i>

12:52.870 --> 12:55.420
Oh.

12:52.870 --> 12:55.460
Gonna sleep. Later.

12:55.370 --> 12:57.080
Oh.

12:55.370 --> 12:57.080
I'll be at college
the day after tomorrow.

12:57.910 --> 13:01.460
<i>He's coming back. Will I see him then?</i>

13:29.090 --> 13:30.870
<i>I left home early.</i>

13:35.940 --> 13:36.920
<i>Is that...</i>

13:40.560 --> 13:41.990
<i>Itsuomi-san!</i>

13:51.780 --> 13:53.130
<i>"Good morning."</i>

13:58.900 --> 14:02.320
<i>My fingers are moving awkwardly.</i>

14:05.720 --> 14:09.460
<i>My world continues to grow since your arrival.</i>

14:09.960 --> 14:14.100
<i>And even my sighs seem 
to blend in effortlessly with it.</i>

14:16.500 --> 14:20.000
<i>I want this to be love.</i>

14:20.930 --> 14:22.420
<i>I would prefer that.</i>

14:29.810 --> 14:33.720
<i>"You learned the signs for common greetings?"</i>

14:33.720 --> 14:36.490
<i>"When did you get back to Japan?"</i>

14:36.490 --> 14:39.000
<i>There's so much I want to ask him.</i>

14:40.660 --> 14:42.330
<i>I could use my phone or a notebook.</i>

14:43.940 --> 14:45.650
Hold out your hand.

14:52.370 --> 14:53.340
<i>He held it!</i>

15:02.960 --> 15:04.460
Laos souvenir.

15:05.120 --> 15:07.050
<i>Right! The souvenir!</i>

15:18.180 --> 15:22.060
<b>Thank you!
I like it very much!</b>

15:36.080 --> 15:38.900
<i>He might've been saying something at the time,</i>

15:39.410 --> 15:42.410
<i>but I couldn't bring myself to look at him.</i>

15:52.520 --> 15:55.310
<i>Why did he pick this?</i>

15:55.310 --> 15:57.100
<i>Is it some kind of god?</i>

15:57.860 --> 16:00.570
<i>It's so creepy, it's wrapped 
around to being kinda cute.</i>

16:01.750 --> 16:06.840
<i>Itsuomi-san must've seen so many 
things I have no knowledge of...</i>

16:09.560 --> 16:11.860
<i>A world I'm not familiar with.</i>

16:15.680 --> 16:18.250
<i>The school for the deaf I went to</i>

16:18.250 --> 16:22.620
<i>included everything from nursery 
to high school in one campus.</i>

16:23.190 --> 16:25.560
<i>My age group had four students in total.</i>

16:40.260 --> 16:45.200
<i>Everyone there was so nice and so warm,</i>

16:45.200 --> 16:47.220
<i>you felt safe there.</i>

16:48.160 --> 16:51.900
<i>That was the entirety of my world.</i>

16:53.080 --> 16:55.160
Yuki!

16:55.880 --> 16:58.160
<i>Oh, Madoka-chan.</i>

17:01.940 --> 17:06.680
<i>And yet, I longed for more.</i>

17:15.380 --> 17:16.580
<i>I want more.</i>

17:25.750 --> 17:26.920
<i>There she is.</i>

17:27.920 --> 17:29.760
<i>They're deep in conversation.</i>

17:29.760 --> 17:32.840
<i>I'd like to talk to her about a bunch 
of stuff concerning Itsuomi-san,</i>

17:33.880 --> 17:37.270
<i>but it's not like we made plans 
to meet up or anything.</i>

17:41.170 --> 17:42.470
<i>Oushi-kun.</i>

17:43.680 --> 17:46.460
<i>What are you standing around for?</i>

17:46.990 --> 17:48.630
<i>Waiting for a friend.</i>

17:49.110 --> 17:50.340
<i>A friend?</i>

17:51.210 --> 17:54.190
What? Working the whole time sounds so sad!

17:54.190 --> 17:55.970
You gotta go on a holiday, right?

17:55.970 --> 17:58.860
I know you two aren't any better off, okay?

18:01.030 --> 18:05.320
<i>They're having a loud chat about 
their plans for spring break.</i>

18:06.500 --> 18:08.980
<i>You don't have to translate that stuff for me.</i>

18:09.520 --> 18:11.480
<i>Please. I know you're curious.</i>

18:16.450 --> 18:20.880
<i>That's the second-year girl who takes 
notes on your laptop for you, right?</i>

18:20.880 --> 18:22.340
<i>What about it?</i>

18:23.350 --> 18:26.220
<i>You call her your friend, huh...</i>

18:26.720 --> 18:31.160
<i>Oushi-kun's sign language 
is always so pointed.</i>

18:32.950 --> 18:39.290
<i>But at times, his fingertips 
look frail—almost meek.</i>

18:39.860 --> 18:45.720
<i>It makes me feel like he must 
be worried for me deep down.</i>

18:47.020 --> 18:53.060
Why the heck
did you have to
come to college?

19:11.750 --> 19:13.540
<i>Itsuomi-san.</i>

19:23.120 --> 19:24.900
<i>Back then,</i>

19:25.310 --> 19:28.220
<i>I had hoped to set foot into the outside world</i>

19:28.220 --> 19:31.130
<i>and went around visiting several 
colleges during open campus.</i>

19:32.150 --> 19:36.490
<i>I found a world there that had 
so many things I didn't know.</i>

19:37.170 --> 19:39.260
<i>The college students I saw</i>

19:39.260 --> 19:43.750
<i>seemed every bit the unattainable 
ideal that TV stars were.</i>

19:46.440 --> 19:48.070
<i>"The outside world."</i>

19:48.830 --> 19:50.440
What's <i>his</i> deal?

19:54.720 --> 19:56.170
<i>Listen, you.</i>

19:56.170 --> 19:57.050
<i>What?</i>

19:57.990 --> 20:00.300
<i>Don't get carried away.</i>

20:01.730 --> 20:02.970
<i>I'm not.</i>

20:03.430 --> 20:05.690
Say, is that sign language?

20:05.690 --> 20:06.380
Huh?

20:06.870 --> 20:08.560
Oh, Yuki.

20:08.560 --> 20:10.180
Wow.

20:10.180 --> 20:12.100
Wonder what they're talking about.

20:22.520 --> 20:24.070
Yuki!

20:24.930 --> 20:26.770
Hello!

20:26.770 --> 20:27.700
Hey.

20:32.080 --> 20:35.300
You should try to avoid suddenly 
clinging to her from behind.

20:35.820 --> 20:37.960
She can't hear footsteps.

20:39.910 --> 20:43.670
Sorry about that. I won't do it again.

20:53.730 --> 20:57.480
Is there anywhere you'd like to go, then?

20:53.730 --> 20:57.480
I couldn't communicate my thoughts at all.

20:55.810 --> 21:00.360
You know that talk
we had about love
or crushing?

20:58.230 --> 21:00.170
Hmm? Uh-huh.

21:08.240 --> 21:10.540
When you speak different 
languages, it changes...

21:23.260 --> 21:25.260
What does that sign
just now mean?

21:25.630 --> 21:29.510
It means "Are you
doing good?" or
"Hang in there!"

21:39.350 --> 21:40.360
Let's go.

21:46.280 --> 21:49.160
<i>Every movement of Itsuomi-san's fingers</i>

21:49.160 --> 21:51.780
<i>stirs these unfamiliar feelings within me.</i>

21:52.770 --> 21:55.330
<i>Every time he looks at me,</i>

21:55.330 --> 21:58.260
<i>I feel such nervous excitement that
I can't bear to look back at him.</i>

21:59.190 --> 22:02.070
<i>This emotion must be love.</i>

22:03.650 --> 22:04.510
<i>I...</i>

22:04.510 --> 22:10.010
To Affection

22:05.750 --> 22:09.100
<i>I've fallen in love with Itsuomi-san.</i>
